email_birthday.body:
Dear {first_name},

Everyone at {company_name} wishes you a very happy birthday! May the year ahead bring you good health, happiness and success.

Your colleagues have left wishes for you on Buzz: {buzz_link}

Warm wishes,
{company_name}

email_work_anniversary.body:
Dear {first_name},

Today marks {years} {years_word} since you joined {company_name}. Thank you for your hard work, ideas and the energy you bring every day.

See what your colleagues are saying on Buzz: {buzz_link}

With gratitude,
{company_name}

email_welcome.body:
Dear {first_name},

Welcome aboard! We are delighted to have you with us as {designation}. Your colleagues have said hello on Buzz: {buzz_link}

See you around,
{company_name}

