letters.review_template:
Dear {employee_name},

Thank you for your contribution during {cycle_name} ({period}). Based on your reviews and the company's calibration, your final rating is {final_rating} – {rating_label}.

{manager_comment}

We look forward to another strong year together.

Warm regards,
{company_name}

letters.increment_template:
Dear {employee_name},

We are pleased to share that, following the {cycle_name}, your annual compensation is revised from {current_ctc} to {new_ctc} ({increment_pct}% increase), effective {effective_date}.{promotion_line}

This letter is confidential. Thank you for your continued contribution.

Warm regards,
{company_name}
